              <div class="p-5 pt-0 text-mediumGray">
                <p>All Xiaomi, Redmi, and POCO devices are supported by the Xiaomi Flash Tool. This includes the latest Xiaomi 14 series, Redmi Note 13 series, and POCO F5 series, as well as older models.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button class="accordion-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-5 text-left font-semibold text-lg focus:outline-none">
              Common flashing issues
              <i class="fas fa-chevron-down transition-transform duration-300"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="p-5 pt-0 text-mediumGray">
                <p>Most issues are resolved by installing the correct drivers and using original USB cables. Ensure your device has sufficient battery (at least 50%) and that you've selected the correct firmware package for your specific device model.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button class="accordion-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-5 text-left font-semibold text-lg focus:outline-none">
