              <i class="fas fa-chevron-down transition-transform duration-300"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="p-5 pt-0 text-mediumGray">
                <p>Always backup your data before flashing. Ensure stable power supply and USB connection during the process. Never disconnect your device during the flashing process to avoid bricking your device. Use original USB cables and follow instructions carefully.</p>
